{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 23,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Job answered and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even to-day ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my complaint bitter: my stroke is heavier than my groaning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that I knew where I might find him! ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I might come ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to his seat!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I would order ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cause before him, and fill my mouth with arguments.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I would know the words ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he would answer me, and understand what he would say to me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would he plead against me with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great power? No; but he would put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "strength",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There the righteous might dispute with him; so should I be delivered for ever from my judge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, I go forward, but he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; and backward, but I cannot perceive him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "On the left hand, where he doth work, but I cannot behold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": he hideth himself on the right hand, that I cannot see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he knoweth the way that I take: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he hath tried me, I shall come forth as gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My foot hath held his steps, his way have I kept, and not declined.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither have I gone back from the commandment of his lips; I have esteemed the words of his mouth more than my necessary ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "food",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in one ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "mind",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and who can turn him? and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "what",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his soul desireth, even ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he doeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he performeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the thing that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " appointed for me: and many such ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore am I troubled at his presence: when I consider, I am afraid of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God maketh my heart soft, and the Almighty troubleth me:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.23.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.23.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because I was not cut off before the darkness, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "neither",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hath he covered the darkness from my face.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
